  "prefLabel": "App 201.01 Purpose and Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "App 201.01 Purpose and Scope. The council conducts proceedings for the purpose of acquiring sufficient information to make fair and reasoned decisions on matters within its statutory jurisdiction, including decisions on applications and complaints filed against apprentices or sponsors. These rules are intended to secure the just, efficient and accurate settlement of all council proceedings.\n\nSource. #6364-B, eff 10-29-96; ss by #7864-A, eff 4-1-03",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/app100-500.html"
